## INS 232 - System Troubleshooting
**Credits**: 3

Presents system troubleshooting theory and real troubleshooting applications. Uses a hands-on approach to provide troubleshooting experience in multiple areas such as programmable logic controllers (PLC), control automation systems and process control systems. Lecture 2 hours. Laboratory 3 hours. Additional course fee applies.
